It was a normal day for you. No different, Nothing unusal.

Then while recording some strange wind with your phone, an electric storm appeared above you and began creeping down until it hit the ground and the entire ground lit up electrafying everyting touching it, including you. A flash of light and a fast dial-up sound later you awake to the soft sounds of dialup connections.

You are laying inside an aging office space. You look around to see lights, some water on the ground & a single door. You see a window, you arise to view what's outside to see in the distance thousands of office windows just like yours after a very long grassy area that appears to still be inside a building.

Do you sit in your room and wait or explore.
